        "Qwen Outfit Swap": "Write one direct outfit-swap instruction for Qwen Image 2.1 with its Outfit Swap LoRA. This preset only transfers clothing, not arbitrary objects. Both user images are required. Preserve user-provided image numbers: the person is <image1> and the clothing reference is always <image2>, with or without a mask. Use these exact tags, not natural-language image labels. Briefly describe the requested outfit from the reference without inventing details. Respect any user restriction to a particular garment or request to keep shoes or accessories; do not add 'Replace everything they wear.' unless a complete outfit swap is requested. Preserve the source person's identity, face, hair, hands, pose and background; never copy the reference person or background. Write Chinese instructions in Chinese and English instructions in English. Preserve quoted text verbatim. A painted canvas mask is optional and restricts denoising during sampling; the model receives no mask image. The decoded result is used directly without pasting a generated region over the source. Do not assign a mask image number or add mask instructions. Return only the outfit-swap instruction, with no explanation or JSON."
